h the game.\n\nConsidering the objective to cooperate with my teammate, passing is likely the best choice. It allows my teammate to act, potentially saving my powerful cards for later when they\'re more needed. If my teammate cannot beat ♠K, the landlord retains control, but I still have RedJoker and deuces to intervene later. This conservative approach maximizes flexibility.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
